sequenceDiagram
  participant Form as LoginForm
  participant Mutation as useLoginMutation
  participant Token as getAccessToken
  participant Keycloak as Keycloak token endpoint
  participant Access as /service/tenant/access
  participant Cookies as token cookies/localStorage
  participant Guard as ProtectedRoute
  Form->>Mutation: username/password/otp
  Mutation->>Token: request token
  Token->>Keycloak: POST token grant
  Keycloak-->>Token: access + refresh tokens
  Mutation->>Access: GET with bearer token
  Access-->>Mutation: tenant access ok
  Mutation->>Cookies: setTokens()
  Guard->>Cookies: read cookies + expiry
  Guard-->>Form: allow protected app or redirect login
